    ["Wheeler–Hendon RMM (rmm.74toRealtime.txt)", "NOAA interpolated OLR, NCEP u850, u200", "For 1974–2013 the file states that both ENSO (SST1) variability and the 120-day mean were removed", "All months", f"BoM file, read through the IMPORTDATA tab of Kate's sheet (the BoM server blocks automated access) {c('wheelerhendon2004')}"],
